==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Stub|BotW}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Stub|TotK}}
Two kinds of Iron Box exist throughout the world in {{TotK}}: dark, dented Iron Boxes and solid, light-colored Iron Boxes. Dented Iron Boxes can be destroyed and may contain [[Item]]s. The solid Iron Boxes cannot be destroyed, however.

==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Two types of Metal Box can be found during [[Battle]]s: small, dented Metal Boxes and large, solid Metal Boxes. If a Box is bombarded by the [[Warrior]]s with [[Electricity]] from a [[Lightning Rod]], a burst of Electricity that stuns and damages nearby [[Enemy|Enemies]] will be generated around it. [[Powerful Foe]]s affected by the Electricity bursts will both be stunned and have their [[Weak-Point Gauge]] made vulnerable. After the Electricity disappears, the Box will break open. They can be frozen with the [[Stasis]] [[Sheikah Rune]] and, being metallic, are also susceptible to [[Magnesis]].

When broken, Metal Boxes may drop one, five, or seven [[Green Rupee]]s, a [[Healing Item]], or nothing.
{{Noncanon|End}}

